        "slc_d9571949a5188a46e386147f4f6a8c0aebe0a993bf9ec79d854ea7195363785c"
      ],
      "text": "Context management uses three compression strategies: autoCompact (summarize old messages via an API call when tokens exceed a threshold), snipCompact, and contextCollapse, the latter two behind feature flags."
    },
